OL,3,ABurnham warned over pensions triple
OL,4,Alock commitment as he prepares for
OL,5,Afirst conference speech as PM
OL,6,
OL,7,FBurnham has not said if he's planning
OL,8,Fto end the triple lock, which is in
OL,9,FLabour's 2024 manifesto, but
OL,10,Fspeculation is rife ahead of his first
OL,11,Fconference speech as PM
OL,13,FEarlier, Deputy Labour leader Lucy
OL,14,FPowell was repeatedly asked about
OL,15,FBurnham's plans - she said the party
OL,16,Fwas "absolutely committed" to the
OL,17,Ftriple lock but wanted a "long-term
OL,18,Fsolution" on social care
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
